<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 60, background: '#FFFFFF' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#123C6E' }}>数据与预处理：RadioMapSeer</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>03 · 实验设置</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#123C6E', marginTop: 18 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 28 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 556, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E5A9E', letterSpacing: 2 }}>DATASET</Text>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 52, borderBottom: '1px solid #D8DEE7' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', width: 130 }}>城市地图</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230' }}>701 张，256 × 256 m²，分辨率 1 m</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 52, borderBottom: '1px solid #D8DEE7' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', width: 130 }}>发射机</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230' }}>每图 80 个，高 1.5 m，全向天线</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 52, borderBottom: '1px solid #D8DEE7' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', width: 130 }}>发射参数</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230' }}>23 dBm，5.9 GHz，单一频点</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 52, borderBottom: '1px solid #D8DEE7' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', width: 130 }}>传播模型</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230' }}>DPM，与 RadioUNet 一致</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 52, borderBottom: '1px solid #D8DEE7' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', width: 130 }}>数据划分</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230' }}>500 / 100 / 100，<span style={{ color: '#C0392B' }}>按城市切分</span></Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', height: 52, borderBottom: '1px solid #D8DEE7' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', width: 130 }}>观测点数</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230' }}>每图 10–300 个，不足 0.5% 像素</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', marginLeft: 60 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E5A9E', letterSpacing: 2 }}>PRE-PROCESSING</Text>

            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#123C6E', width: 34 }}>①</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 470 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>线性归一化</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>
                        路径损耗 [−127, −47] dB 线性映射到 [0, 1]。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 18 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#123C6E', width: 34 }}>②</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 470 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>阈值截断</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>
                        归一化值低于 0.2 的像素置零，去掉极弱与噪声信号。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 18 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#123C6E', width: 34 }}>③</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', width: 470 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>重新拉伸</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#5A6675', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 4 }}>
                        剩余值再归一化到 [0, 1]，恢复动态范围。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ background: '#E8F0FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #123C6E', padding: '14px 18px', marginTop: 22 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    阈值化是容易被忽略的一步：它把"弱到无意义"的信号变成真正的空白，模型必须先学会判断哪里本来就没有信号。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
